00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:59.600
plans to reduce production of its latest

00:09:56.560 --> 00:10:01.600
gaming GPUs by up to 40% as it grapples

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:04.640
with the DRAM shortage. And Gartner

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.000
predicts PC prices will rise by 17% this

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.080
year.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:09.040
>> And this is a major problem because if

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:11.400
Nvidia itself is anticipating supply

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:13.240
shortages, then all those future data

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:15.520
center construction projects will not

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:17.680
have the necessary components to operate

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:20.080
and therefore many of them will begin to

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:23.040
be canceled or delayed just as is

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:23.040
happening today.

